  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "On set, a crewman's ringing pager ruins a dramatic spy scene and sends Muranishi into a fury—right before Muranishi's own cell phone rings with news from the bank Section Chief of an evening meeting. Listen for \"shoudan\", a business negotiation.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "カット！何の音だ？誰だこれ、止めろ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "撮影中は電源オフだって！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "すいませんじゃないだろ！気をつけろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "はい、じゃあすぐもう一回いくぞ。よーい、アクション！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ああ、どうでしたか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "バッチリです！商談するアポが取れましたよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ホントですか、ありがとうございます！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "ちなみに今日の夕方なんですけど、いかがですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "もちろん大丈夫です。すぐに終わらせますので。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "それでは後ほど。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "よし、いくぞ！甘やかすな！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "よーい、アクション！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "カット！何の音だ？誰だこれ、止めろ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Cut! What is that beeping sound? Whose is it—turn it off!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "撮影中は電源オフだって！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We told you to switch the power off during filming!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "すいませんじゃないだろ！気をつけろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Saying sorry doesn't fix the take! Be careful.'",
      "gap": 0.45
