    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "はい、じゃあすぐもう一回いくぞ。よーい、アクション！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All right, let's go again right away. Ready, action!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ああ、どうでしたか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello—how did the meeting arrangement go?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
